<%--
Rsx_Default_Spinner

The framework's stock spinner: a plain spinning circle. This one fills the box its host
gives it, centered, and draws in currentColor so it reads on any surface - the host owns
the box, the spinner owns what it does with it (see Spinner.jqhtml). Applications
replace it by registering their own
component with Rsx.set_default_spinner() at init; this one exists so a fresh RSpade app
has a working spinner before it has designed one.
--%>
<Define:Rsx_Default_Spinner tag="div">
    <div class="Rsx_Default_Spinner__circle"></div>
</Define:Rsx_Default_Spinner>
